---
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Visuals" description="Interactive data visualizations on factory farming, carbon footprints, and AI water usage." ogImage="/images/og/og-visuals.png">
  <section class="simple-directory">
    <p class="simple-directory__intro">
      Interactive companions to the writing: argument maps, comparisons, and visual explanations for topics that are easier to grasp when you can move around inside them.
    </p>

    <ul class="simple-directory__list">
      <li class="simple-directory__item simple-directory__item--stacked">
        <a href="/visuals/factory-farmed-chickens" class="simple-directory__link">Factory-farmed chickens</a>
        <p class="simple-directory__note">A scale-based visualization of how many chickens are raised and killed each year.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="simple-directory__item simple-directory__item--stacked">
        <a href="/visuals/carbon-footprint" class="simple-directory__link">Carbon footprint: lifestyle cuts vs changing the grid</a>
        <p class="simple-directory__note">A calculator that compares personal emissions cuts with higher-leverage changes to the energy system.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="simple-directory__item simple-directory__item--stacked">
        <a href="/visuals/water" class="simple-directory__link">How thirsty is AI?</a>
        <p class="simple-directory__note">A data-backed comparison of AI water claims against other common uses of water.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</Base>
